# Temporary and local runtime data — the whole tree is app-generated at
# runtime (models, datasets, embeddings, JSON histories, logs); none of it
# is source code. Ignoring the whole directory instead of a few subpaths
# because ~1300 previously-untracked runtime files were found accumulating
# here unignored (Phase 1B baseline audit).
data_warehouse/
*.log

# Phase 13 PostgreSQL backup artifacts and safe metadata manifests
backups/
*.dump
*.backup.json

# C1.1: runtime security state (dev pseudonym key, login throttle) — never commit
data_warehouse/security/

